        "text": "什么样的画面是有张力的",
        "representativeTime": 104.665,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-036.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-037",
        "start": 105.43,
        "end": 108.074,
        "text": "这一点也是我们需要在日常生活中去积累的",
        "representativeTime": 106.752,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-037.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-038",
        "start": 108.074,
        "end": 112.39,
        "text": "此外呢变得需要有常识和杂识，和杂识就是你要有一些莫名其妙的知识",
        "representativeTime": 110.232,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-038.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-011",
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-039",
        "start": 112.4,
        "end": 113.852,
        "text": "做编导呢就是什么都懂一点",
        "representativeTime": 113.126,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-039.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-040",
        "start": 113.852,
        "end": 115.909,
        "text": "只有需要的时候再把这个东西再弄到精",
        "representativeTime": 114.881,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-040.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-041",
        "start": 115.909,
        "end": 120.51,
        "text": "那么最后问题来了，我们现在知道我们需要这三方面的能力了，我们要怎么去培养呢？",
        "representativeTime": 118.21,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-041.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-012",
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-042",
        "start": 120.52,
        "end": 126.19,
        "text": "第一点就是少拆爆款多刷，在阅读爆款这个上，一是求多不求精的，不要假努力",
        "representativeTime": 123.355,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-042.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-043",
        "start": 126.2,
        "end": 128.162,
        "text": "第二点呢就是用好你的点赞和收藏",
        "representativeTime": 127.181,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-043.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-044",
        "start": 128.162,
        "end": 132.61,
        "text": "你的点赞和收藏就是你的素材库，在你点赞一条视频之前一定要三视反复筛选",
        "representativeTime": 130.386,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-044.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-013",
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-045",
        "start": 132.62,
        "end": 135.563,
        "text": "并且保持每天多次观看你的点赞和收藏的习惯",
        "representativeTime": 134.091,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-045.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-046",
        "start": 135.563,
        "end": 136.74,
        "text": "要做一个好的编导",
        "representativeTime": 136.151,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-046.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-047",
        "start": 136.74,
        "end": 140.713,
        "text": "你必须要三秒钟脑中里面就能想到对标博主bgm和视频形式",
        "representativeTime": 138.726,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-047.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-048",
        "start": 140.713,
        "end": 142.48,
        "text": "五秒钟找到具体的对应视频",
        "representativeTime": 141.596,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-048.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-049",
        "start": 142.49,
        "end": 148,
        "text": "那么第三点，如何去培养我们刚刚说写脚本里面的画面想象力呢，就是多在你的脑中拍电影",
        "representativeTime": 145.245,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-049.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-014",
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-050",
        "start": 148.01,
        "end": 151.077,
        "text": "最后一点呢，就是为了锻炼我们的需求感知力和共情力",
        "representativeTime": 149.543,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-050.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-051",
        "start": 151.077,
        "end": 155.55,
        "text": "我们要多站在别人的视角去想问题，你一定不要把自己控制在一个信息茧房里面",
        "representativeTime": 153.314,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-051.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-015",
          "SHOT-016",
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-052",
        "start": 155.56,
        "end": 156.76,
        "text": "你要去反过来大数据",
        "representativeTime": 156.16,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-052.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-053",
        "start": 156.76,
        "end": 160.227,
        "text": "你的大数据让系统给你推荐那些可能根本不是你爱看的东西",
        "representativeTime": 158.493,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-053.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-017",
          "SHOT-018"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-054",
        "start": 160.227,
        "end": 163.561,
        "text": "那么今天就说到这里，我是人类最强编导，我们下期再见",
        "representativeTime": 161.894,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-054.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-018"
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
